### Component 7: Automated Isolation Validation Script

#### [NEW] [validate-isolation.sh](file:///home/aneesh/Documents/python/docker/rawadhv2/myproject_agent_skill_prompt_files/validate-isolation.sh)

A bash script that validates any framework package for strict isolation. Checks for:
- Absolute paths (`/home/...`)
- Parent path escapes in `.md`/`.json` files that reference outside the package (`../PROJECT_SETUP.md`, `../automation/README.md`, `../../automation/README.md`)
- References to sibling frameworks
- References to root-only files (`manifest.json`, root `AGENTS.md`)
- Missing essential directories (`agents/`, `skills/`)

Usage:
```bash
./validate-isolation.sh django/
./validate-isolation.sh react/
./validate-isolation.sh flutter/mobile/
```

